---
const primaryAreas = ["津市", "松阪市", "鈴鹿市"];
const otherAreas = ["伊勢市", "名張市", "伊賀市", "亀山市", "桑名市", "他三重県全域"];

// マップ画像上のピン位置（パーセント）
const pins = [
  { city: "津", top: "44%", left: "55%" },
  { city: "松阪", top: "55%", left: "52%" },
  { city: "鈴鹿", top: "32%", left: "60%" },
];
---

<section id="area" class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-sky-mist to-sky-pale py-16 md:py-24 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-sky-light/30 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="label-en">SERVICE AREA</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-text mt-2">
        三重県全域に<span class="text-navy">対応しています</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 border border-line-soft">
        <div class="relative">
          <img
            src="/assets/mie-map.png"
            alt="三重県エリアマップ"
            class="w-full h-auto"
          />
          {
            pins.map((p) => (
              <div
                class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-full"
                style={`top: ${p.top}; left: ${p.left};`}
              >
                <div class="relative">
                  <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-accent/40 animate-ping" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></span>
                  <span class="relative block w-[18px] h-[18px] rounded-full bg-accent shadow-md ring-2 ring-white"></span>
                  <span class="absolute top-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mt-1 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px] font-black text-accent-deep bg-white/90 px-1.5 rounded">
                    {p.city}
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 justify-center text-xs">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
          <span class="text-muted">主要エリア（津市・松阪市・鈴鹿市）</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-text-soft mb-7 leading-relaxed">
          津市・松阪市・鈴鹿市を中心に、三重県全域へお伺いいたします。地域密着で迅速な対応が可能です。
        </p>

        <div class="mb-6">
          <div class="text-xs text-muted font-bold mb-3">主要対応エリア</div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              primaryAreas.map((a) => (
                <span class="bg-navy text-white text-sm font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm">
                  {a}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="text-xs text-muted font-bold mb-3">その他対応エリア</div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              otherAreas.map((a) => (
                <span class="bg-white text-navy text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-sky-light">
                  {a}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-line-soft shadow-sm">
            <div class="num-mont text-base text-navy font-black leading-tight">三重県全域</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1">対応エリア</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-line-soft shadow-sm">
            <div class="num-mont text-base text-accent-deep font-black">無料</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1">県内出張費</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-line-soft shadow-sm">
            <div class="num-mont text-base text-navy font-black leading-tight">即日相談OK</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1">お見積もり</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-sm text-text-soft border border-sky-light flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl shrink-0">💬</span>
          <span>
            エリア外の方もまずはお気軽にご相談ください。出張対応の可否を確認のうえ、ご回答いたします。
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
